    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d708">

                <pb facs="0685" n="679" sameAs="frus:frus1894app1/pg679"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Ketteler to Mr. Adee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Elberon, N. J.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-08-03"><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>As the Department’s note of 1st August contains no reference to Mr. Schmidt’s
                    appointment may I ask for an early reply with regard thereto?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Ketteler.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
